+# Torch bridge tests (W8J J1)
+
+These tests need torch and therefore run in the dedicated environment, not in
+the system-python suite:
+
+```bash
+/home/chiro/miniforge3/envs/pypto-x-w8j/bin/python -m pytest -q \
+  --confcutdir=python/tests/framework_torch python/tests/framework_torch
+```
+
+`--confcutdir` is required: the repository-root `conftest.py` registers
+pytest-xdist hooks that are intentionally absent from the lightweight torch
+environment.
+
+The suite is deliberately outside `python/tests/ut`, so the main
+`python/tests/ut/pypto_x` collection (815 tests at base `26a444b8`) is
+unaffected.  The torch-free optional-dependency checks live in
+`python/tests/ut/pypto_x/test_framework_torch_optional.py`.
